[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048350717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108395#issuecomment-3048350717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108395","id":3048350717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61siP9","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T10:39:32Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T10:39:32Z","body":"Checked the code and this is likely an issue in core, as the post-initialization is called *before* the object reference is returned, and therefore before it has any chance of being referenced\n\nThis might also be a GDScript issue, would be good to check what happens if this is constructed on the C++ side, but probably the same result\n\nI'm not sure this can be supported though, I can't see any reasonable way to handle this as the ref it is put into isn't constructed yet\n\nOne possible solution would be to somehow have some check while it is being initialized to ensure it has a valid reference lying around, but that might cause various problems on its own, perhaps instead it would be best to add a check or something to fail if a ref counted is referenced like this in this case","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048350717/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048350795","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108395#issuecomment-3048350795","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108395","id":3048350795,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61siRL","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T10:39:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T10:52:22Z","body":"```gdscript\nextends RefCounted\nclass_name Rc\n\nfunc _notification(what: int) -> void:\n    if what == NOTIFICATION_POSTINITIALIZE:\n        print(\"post init\")\n        print(get_reference_count())\n        var a = self\n        print(a.get_reference_count())\n\n        var b = self\n        print(b.get_reference_count())\n```\nI also tested `NOTIFICATION_POSTINITIALIZE`  in gdscript, but it didn't receive postinitialize at all and there was no output.\n\nAnd refcount works correctly in gdscript's `_init`:\n```gdscript\nfunc _init() -> void:\n        print(\"init\")\n        print(get_reference_count())\n        var a = self\n        print(a.get_reference_count())\n\n        var b = self\n        print(b.get_reference_count())\n```\n```\ninit\n2\n3\n4\n1\n--- Debugging process stopped ---\n```\n\nEdit: \n😅This is as expected as docs said:\n>Notification received when the object is initialized, before its script is attached. Used internally.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048350795/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048712433","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108395#issuecomment-3048712433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108395","id":3048712433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61t6jx","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T12:21:11Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T12:21:11Z","body":"I do see postinit executes immediately after the instance is constructed, at which point the `RefCounted::refcount_init` has not been initialized. That is to say, the behavior of postinit is similar to constructor.\nThis seems unsolvable, I don't see how `RefCounted` can distinguish whether it is being referenced within postinit/constructor or externally\n\n So closing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048712433/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3200454409","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108395#issuecomment-3200454409","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108395","id":3200454409,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-ww8J","user":{"login":"Bromeon","id":708488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/708488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Bromeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T11:56:11Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T11:56:11Z","body":"I do think there is some value in at least discussing whether we should support something like this.\n\nNot having reliable ref-counting during initialization requires non-trivial workarounds in GDExtension (retaining extra strong pointer + deferred destruction, see https://github.com/godot-rust/gdext/pull/1273 and https://github.com/godot-rust/gdext/pull/1211). It makes it quite hard to have deterministic destruction of `RefCounted` instances after their creation, without running into UB or memory leaks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3200454409/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352724288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108395#issuecomment-3352724288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108395","id":3352724288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H1oNA","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnop